OL,3,GNEWSAMan who hurt baby and tried to
OL,4,Acover it up jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who tried to cover up his assault
OL,7,Fon a four-week-old baby has been
OL,8,Fjailed.
OL,10,FErnest Oakley, 32, from Swanton Road in
OL,11,FNorwich, was sentenced to 14 months at
OL,12,FNorwich Crown Court on Wednesday.
OL,14,FThe court heard how he took the baby to
OL,15,FNorfolk and Norwich University Hospital
OL,16,Fin November 2023, claiming another
OL,17,Fyoung child had accidentally kicked him
OL,18,Fin the head.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
